        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wilfrid Brambell, Harry H. Corbett, Paul McCartney\n- Films/TV: Steptoe and Son Ride Again, A Hard Day's Night, Some Will, Some Won't, Steptoe and Son\n- Roles/Characters: Paul McCartney's fictional grandfather, Henry Russell\n\nFacts:\n- Wilfrid Brambell and Harry H. Corbett starred in the film \"Steptoe and Son Ride Again.\"\n- Wilfrid Brambell appeared alongside the Beatles in the film \"A Hard Day's Night\" and played Paul McCartney's fictional grandfather.\n- Wilfrid Brambell, identified as a \"Steptoe and Son\" actor, made a cameo in \"Some Will, Some Won't\" as Henry Russell.\n- In \"Some Will, Some Won't,\" Henry Russell leaves four family members £150,000 in his will on the condition that they complete bizarre tasks he set for them.",
